18:T4ef,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is SAT required to study in Turkey?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Not for every route. Universities publish accepted exam and diploma alternatives. Check the chosen institution and programme rather than assuming a national SAT requirement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is a Denklik certificate for university registration?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In this context it means school-level equivalence handled through MEB and its equivalence centres. Check the registrar’s exact requirement and do not confuse it with recognition of a foreign university degree."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I apply before final school results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the institution. The reviewed Bilkent page does not evaluate predicted results, while other institutions describe different interim-document rules. Use the current programme instructions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does an accepted minimum score guarantee admission?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Programme quotas and evaluation still apply. A minimum establishes an application threshold, not a guaranteed offer."}}]}1:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"editorial-page editorial-page--guide","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/turkey-university-admission-requirements/\",\"name\":\"Turkey university admission requirements and Denklik\",\"description\":\"Compare Turkish university entry routes, SAT/ACT and school qualifications, language evidence, application documents and MEB school Denklik steps.\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/turkey-university-admission-requirements/\",\"inLanguage\":\"en\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-29\",\"dateModified\":\"20