21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-SAT, ACT, TR-YÖS and national diplomas",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"SAT, ACT, TR-YÖS and national diplomas"}],[["$","p","Compare the accepted qualification, not only the score. Subject conditions, validity periods, result sessions and the intended programme can change whether a route is usable. Do not combine different universities’ minima into a fictional national standard.",{"children":"Compare the accepted qualification, not only the score. Subject conditions, validity periods, result sessions and the intended programme can change whether a route is usable. Do not combine different universities’ minima into a fictional national standard."}],["$","p","For example, the dated matrix linked by METU distinguishes qualifications and additional mathematics conditions, while Bilkent’s application page lists its own international and national routes. Sabancı’s FAQ explicitly describes SAT and TR-YÖS as options rather than compulsory tests for every applicant.",{"children":"For example, the dated matrix linked by METU distinguishes qualifications and additional mathematics conditions, while Bilkent’s application page lists its own international and national routes. Sabancı’s FAQ explicitly describes SAT and TR-YÖS as options rather than compulsory tests for every applicant."}],["$","p","Original decision case: a student has a strong final school diploma and one accepted international result. They first check which of the two makes them eligible at each university. They prepare another exam only where the existing evidence does not meet the route or where there is a clear application benefit.",{"children":"Original decision case: a student has a strong final school diploma and one accepted international result. They first check which of the two makes them eligible at each university. They prepare another exam only where the existing evidence does not meet the route or where there is a clear application benefit."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/37",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iso.metu.edu.tr/en/node/37","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"METU accepted qualifications"}]]}],["$","span","https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/how-to-apply/",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://w3.bilkent.edu.tr/international/how-to-apply/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Bilkent application qualifications"}]]}],["$","span","https://iro.sabanciuniv.edu/en/degree-students/frequently-asked-questions/admission-applications",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iro.sabanciuniv.edu/en/degree-students/frequently-asked-questions/admission-applications","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Sabancı admissions FAQ"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for SAT, ACT, TR-YÖS and national diplomas","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/tr-yos-exam/",{"href":"/guides/tr-yos-exam/","children":["TR-YÖS session and application guide",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2-Build two document folders",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build two document folders"}],[["$","p","One folder supports evaluation; the other supports final registration. A university may accept a provisional document at one stage and require the original later. Check that explicitly rather than assuming all institutions follow the same practice.",{"children":"One folder supports evaluation; the other supports final registration. A university may accept a provisional document at one stage and require the original later. Check that explicitly rather than assuming all institutions follow the same practice."}]],"$undefined","$L25","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L26"]}],"$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b"]}]
